C1: Changing found to false for an unmatched IReadOnlyList<IFormFile> causes a required constructor parameter to report a mapping error where the old mapper supplied an empty collection. Consider mapping a complex type with constructor IReadOnlyList<IFormFile> files and a populated non-file property, with form files named otherFile and none named files.
